# Collapsible sidebar reference

A shadcn Sidebar paste is saved for a later pass. Do not build it until the user asks to use it.

- Archive: `.cursor/saved/shadcn-sidebar/Sidebar.original.tsx`
- Brief: `.cursor/saved/shadcn-sidebar/CURSOR_BRIEF.md`

When that pass starts, port the structure (provider, collapse, menu, footer, trigger) into this repo’s JSX and CSS. Do not add `cn`, `@/` aliases, `lucide-react`, Radix, or class-variance-authority. This is not the admin `/panel` sidebar (`admin-sidebar-nav`).
